      "sources": [
        "https://developers.openai.com/api/docs/models/gpt-3.5-turbo.md",
        "https://developers.openai.com/api/docs/concepts.md"
      ],
      "checked": "2026-11-14"
    },
    {
      "id": "openai-gpt-5-chat",
      "match": "gpt-5[.-]?\\d?-chat",
      "charsPerToken": 4,
      "contextWindow": 128000,
      "maxImages": 1500,
      "note": "The chat models of GPT-5 to GPT-5.3 (gpt-5-chat-latest, gpt-5.1-chat-latest) have a 128,000 window. The docs give no image rule for them. The model `chat-latest` has a larger window, and is in `openai`.",
      "sources": [
        "https://developers.openai.com/api/docs/models/gpt-5-chat-latest.md",
        "https://developers.openai.com/api/docs/models/gpt-5.1-chat-latest.md",
        "https://developers.openai.com/api/docs/guides/images-vision.md",
        "https://developers.openai.com/api/docs/concepts.md"
      ],
      "checked": "2026-11-14"
    },
    {
      "id": "openai-gpt-4o-mini",
      "match": "gpt-4o-mini",
      "charsPerToken": 4,
      "imageTokens": { "rule": "tiles", "fitPx": 2048, "shortSidePx": 768, "tilePx": 512, "baseTokens": 2833, "tileTokens": 5667 },
      "contextWindow": 128000,
      "maxImages": 1500,
      "sources": [
        "https://developers.openai.com/api/docs/guides/images-vision.md",
        "https://developers.openai.com/api/docs/models/gpt-4o-mini.md",
        "https://developers.openai.com/api/docs/concepts.md"
      ],
      "checked": "2026-11-14"
    },
    {
      "id": "openai-small-patches",
      "match": "gpt-4[.-]?1-(mini|nano)|gpt-5-nano|(^|/|openai-)o4-mini",
      "charsPerToken": 4,
      "imageTokens": { "rule": "patches", "patchPx": 32, "maxPatches": 30000, "tokensPerPatch": 2.46 },
      "contextWindow": 200000,
      "maxImages": 1500,
      "note": "The older small models that count an image in patches of 32 px, each with its own multiplier: gpt-5-nano 1.5, gpt-4.1-mini 1.62, o4-mini 1.72, gpt-4.1-nano 2.46. The largest multiplier counts. The window is that of o4-mini, the smallest (gpt-5-nano takes 272,000 input tokens, and gpt-4.1-mini has 1,047,576).",
      "sources": [
        "https://developers.openai.com/api/docs/guides/images-vision.md",
        "https://developers.openai.com/api/docs/models/o4-mini.md",
        "https://developers.openai.com/api/docs/models/gpt-5-nano.md",
        "https://developers.openai.com/api/docs/models/gpt-4.1-nano.md",
        "https://developers.openai.com/api/docs/concepts.md"
      ],
      "checked": "2026-11-14"
    },
    {
      "id": "openai-gpt-5-tiles",
      "match": "gpt-5[.-]?1(?!\\d)|gpt-5(-\\d{4}-\\d\\d-\\d\\d)?(?![.\\w-])",
      "charsPerToken": 4,
      "imageTokens": { "rule": "tiles", "fitPx": 2048, "shortSidePx": 768, "tilePx": 512, "baseTokens": 70, "tileTokens": 140 },
      "contextWindow": 272000,
      "maxImages": 1500,
      "note": "gpt-5 and gpt-5.1 (with its Codex models) count an image in tiles. The window is the most input tokens of gpt-5; its whole window, and that of gpt-5.1, is 400,000.",
      "sources": [
        "https://developers.openai.com/api/docs/guides/images-vision.md",
        "https://developers.openai.com/api/docs/models/gpt-5.md",
        "https://developers.openai.com/api/docs/models/gpt-5.1.md",
        "https://developers.openai.com/api/docs/concepts.md"
      ],
      "checked": "2026-11-14"
    },
    {
      "id": "openai-tiles",
      "match": "gpt-4o|gpt-4[.-]?1(?!\\d)|(^|/|openai-)o[13](?![\\w.])",
      "charsPerToken": 4,
      "imageTokens": { "rule": "tiles", "fitPx": 2048, "shortSidePx": 768, "tilePx": 512, "baseTokens": 85, "tileTokens": 170 },
      "contextWindow": 128000,
      "maxImages": 1500,
      "note": "The other models that count an image in tiles: gpt-4o and gpt-4.1 (85 and 170 tokens), o1, o1-pro, and o3 (75 and 150). The larger pair counts. The window is that of gpt-4o, o1-mini, and o1-preview, the smallest (o1 and o3 have 200,000, and gpt-4.1 has 1,047,576).",
      "sources": [
        "https://developers.openai.com/api/docs/guides/images-vision.md",
        "https://developers.openai.com/api/docs/models/gpt-4o.md",
        "https://developers.openai.com/api/docs/models/o1-mini.md",
        "https://developers.openai.com/api/docs/concepts.md"
      ],
      "checked": "2026-11-14"
    },
    {
      "id": "openai-gpt-4-128k",
      "match": "gpt-4-turbo|gpt-4[.-]?5(?!\\d)",
      "charsPerToken": 4,
      "contextWindow": 128000,
      "note": "gpt-4-turbo and gpt-4.5-preview. The docs give no image rule for them.",
      "sources": [
        "https://developers.openai.com/api/docs/models/gpt-4-turbo.md",
        "https://developers.openai.com/api/docs/models/gpt-4.5-preview.md",
        "https://developers.openai.com/api/docs/concepts.md"
      ],
      "checked": "2026-11-14"
    },
    {
      "id": "openai-gpt-4",
      "match": "gpt-4(?![.o\\d])",
      "charsPerToken": 4,
      "contextWindow": 8192,
      "note": "gpt-4 and its dated copies. An old preview copy of gpt-4-turbo with a dated id (gpt-4-1106-preview) comes here too, with a window that is too small, which only compacts early.",
      "sources": [
        "https://developers.openai.com/api/docs/models/gpt-4.md",
        "https://developers.openai.com/api/docs/concepts.md"
      ],
      "checked": "2026-11-14"
    },
    {
      "id": "openai",
      "match": "gpt-[5-9]|chat-latest",
      "charsPerToken": 4,
      "imageTokens": { "rule": "patches", "patchPx": 32, "maxPatches": 30000, "tokensPerPatch": 1.2 },
      "contextWindow": 272000,
      "maxImages": 1500,
      "note": "Every other GPT model from GPT-5 on. Image: patches of 32 px with the multiplier 1.2 (gpt-5-mini, gpt-5.2, gpt-5.4 to gpt-6). The API refuses an image of more than 30,000 patches; gpt-5.2 to gpt-5.5 first make an image smaller (to 2,500, 6,144, or 10,000 patches), so this count is too high for a large image. The window is the most input tokens of the models with a 400,000 window (gpt-5.4-mini, chat-latest, gpt-5-codex); gpt-5.4 and later have 1,050,000, with 922,000 input tokens from gpt-5.6 on.",
      "sources": [
        "https://developers.openai.com/api/docs/guides/images-vision.md",
        "https://developers.openai.com/api/docs/models/gpt-5.4-mini.md",
        "https://developers.openai.com/api/docs/models/chat-latest.md",
        "https://developers.openai.com/api/docs/models/gpt-5.6-sol.md",
        "https://developers.openai.com/api/docs/concepts.md"
      ],
      "checked": "2026-11-14"
    },
    {
      "id": "gemini-image",
      "match": "gemini[\\w.-]*image|nano-banana",
      "charsPerToken": 4,
      "imageTokens": { "rule": "fixed", "tokens": 2304 },
      "contextWindow": 65536,
      "note": "The Gemini models that make images. The window is the input limit of gemini-2.5-flash-image, gemini-3-pro-image, and gemini-3.1-flash-lite-image, the smallest (gemini-3.1-flash-image has 131,072). The image count is that of `gemini-2`, the larger one.",
      "sources": [
        "https://aistudio.google.com/docs/models/gemini-3-pro-image.md",
        "https://aistudio.google.com/docs/models/gemini-2.5-flash-image.md",
        "https://aistudio.google.com/docs/media-resolution.md",
        "https://aistudio.google.com/docs/tokens.md"
      ],
      "checked": "2026-11-14"
    },
    {
      "id": "gemini-128k",
      "match": "gemini[\\w.-]*(computer-use|native-audio|live|omni|robotics)",
      "charsPerToken": 4,
      "imageTokens": { "rule": "fixed", "tokens": 2304 },
      "contextWindow": 128000,
      "note": "The Gemini models with a small input limit: the computer use model (128,000, the smallest), and the live, native audio, omni, and robotics models (131,072). The image count is that of `gemini-2`, the larger one.",
      "sources": [
        "https://aistudio.google.com/docs/models/gemini-2.5-computer-use-preview-10-2025.md",
        "https://aistudio.google.com/docs/models/gemini-omni-flash.md",
        "https://aistudio.google.com/docs/media-resolution.md",
        "https://aistudio.google.com/docs/tokens.md"
