      "contextWindow": 1048576,
      "maxImages": 3600,
      "note": "Gemini 3 and Gemini 4. Image: 1,120 tokens with no media resolution in the request, which is what Dez sends. The window is the input limit of Gemini 3 and the window of Gemini 4.",
      "sources": [
        "https://aistudio.google.com/docs/media-resolution.md",
