    {
      "id": "grok",
      "match": "grok",
      "contextWindow": 256000,
      "maxImages": null,
      "note": "The window is that of grok-build-0.1, the smallest (grok-4.5 to grok-4.7 have 500,000; grok-4.3 and grok-4.20 have 1,000,000). \"Maximum number of images: No limit\". The docs give no characters per token and no image token rule.",
